        "text": {
          "en": "Area is the surface covered by a shape. We measure it in square units such as cm squared and m squared.\nArea of a rectangle is length times breadth. Area of a square is side times side.\nA rectangle 6 cm long and 4 cm wide has area 24 cm squared, and its perimeter is 20 cm."
